menu "Timekeeping"

config TIMEKEEPING_KEEP_RTC_MORE
    bool "Keep a synced clock across USB / JTAG resets and short deep sleeps"
    default n
    help
        The RTC timer keeps counting through ESP_RST_USB, ESP_RST_JTAG and a deep-sleep wake. With this on, those
        resets keep a synced clock synced (a deep sleep only while it was shorter than 1 h; a longer one turns the
        clock approximate for RC drift). Off (the default, the PixelClip): only software resets, panics and
        watchdogs keep trust, as before.

endmenu
